			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Dependency and Element submodules — Tauri permission reformatting and Element upstream sync\n\nUpdate the Dependency submodule from 799a2371 to f5ef9358, advancing the Tauri ecosystem with upstream permission reference table formatting standardization. Flatten nested HTML table structures into simpler single-line rows with consistent spacing across dialog, fs, log, and shell plugin permissions, plus all core Tauri crates (app, event, image, menu, path, resources, tray, webview, window).\n\nUpdate the Element submodule from 061a4d48 to b5c792a9, batch-synchronizing all nine submodules (Common, Echo, Maintain, Mountain, Output, Rest, SideCar, Sky, Wind, Worker) to their latest upstream revisions. Captures the upstream SideCar refactor that removes the Spawn module and updates associated documentation references.\n\nAll changes are upstream synchronization and documentation formatting adjustments with no functional behavior changes in Land.",
